{
 "meta": {
  "lane": "b",
  "task": "t120",
  "chunk": "b/016",
  "family": "ICE60"
 },
 "entries": [
  {
   "key": "u03044",
   "en": "I don't know why they keep throwing themselves against our defenses. Even animals should learn not to stick their noses where it hurts.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03045",
   "en": "I'll do whatever I can.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03046",
   "en": "We're all in the same boat.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03047",
   "en": "They always attack here? It's an obvious killzone.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03049",
   "en": "I'd be stupid to not help.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03050",
   "en": "Kind of a futile attack.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03051",
   "en": "Warning! Watchdog Protocol is active.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_04_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE60_11_PLC_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03052",
   "en": "I'm unarmed!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03053",
   "en": "I won't cause any trouble! I won't!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE60_07_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03054",
   "en": "I wish they'd let us work. If I had something to do, it'd take my mind off...",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03055",
   "en": "Zev says the others are recovering. Guess they'll be awake when they're eaten.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03056",
   "en": "What was that noise? Did rachni get in here? Did you kill them?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03057",
   "en": "It could be worse, right? I could be one of those guys in the med bay.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03058",
   "en": "Got to keep the mood light. I mean, if you don't laugh, you'll-- Yeah. You just have to.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03059",
   "en": "I should have taken my vacation. No, I had to get those last few alleles nailed down.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03060",
   "en": "Ventralis kept us all alive. He must know what he's doing.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03061",
   "en": "You'll do something about those things, right?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03062",
   "en": "Stop! I'm not a threat!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03063",
   "en": "Maybe the bean-counters will review my request for more lab safety features.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03064",
   "en": "We were running on batteries before the connection to Central was restored.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03065",
   "en": "I'm more afraid of the guards now. They've been getting twitchy.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03066",
   "en": "I used to have nightmares like this. Too many cheap horror vids before lights-out.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03067",
   "en": "Can you get us off the mountain?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03068",
   "en": "I didn't think we'd ever need the guards here.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03069",
   "en": "Everywhere I go, I'm the only survivor. Maybe you'd better stand back.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03070",
   "en": "They came out of there.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03071",
   "en": "About the rachni?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03072",
   "en": "Rachni? That's preposterous.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03073",
   "en": "Don't screw with me. They can't be rachni.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03074",
   "en": "Rachni? I don't believe that.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03075",
   "en": "\"Rachni?\" I think I've heard that before.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03076",
   "en": "I've heard that word before.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03077",
   "en": "They found it in a derelict ship. An egg. Waiting since the last battles. They brought it here--",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03078",
   "en": "Shut up! God. You want to get us killed?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03079",
   "en": "I don't have any control over who lives or dies here. Do you?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03080",
   "en": "If you're going to be crazy, be the quiet kind.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03081",
   "en": "It's possible. The specimens were sensitive to biotics.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03082",
   "en": "I killed her.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03083",
   "en": "Who?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_01_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03084",
   "en": "Answer the question.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03085",
   "en": "Doctor Zhonmua. We were going to lunch when the alarms went off. I ran into the tram. And I closed the doors.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03086",
   "en": "She banged on the window once. Then they sliced her to pieces. Her head came apart like a melon.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03087",
   "en": "I closed the door. I killed her.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03088",
   "en": "You think I want absolution? There is none.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03089",
   "en": "Of course. That is perfectly true.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03090",
   "en": "You came to find out about them, didn't you?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03091",
   "en": "I wish I were crazy. It would be easier.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03092",
   "en": "I'm Olar. Han Olar.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03093",
   "en": "I need to know more about those things out there.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03094",
   "en": "Where did they come from?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03095",
   "en": "You're involved in this. What can you tell me?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03096",
   "en": "Could Matriarch Benezia survive in the hot labs?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03097",
   "en": "I heard you were at the hot labs. How did you make it out alive?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03098",
   "en": "Tell me what you know. I'll make your survival mean something.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03099",
   "en": "The only thing you could do was save yourself.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03100",
   "en": "If you hadn't, you'd be dead, too.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03101",
   "en": "You mean those things out there?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03102",
   "en": "Are you trying to be cryptic, or are you just nuts?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03103",
   "en": "And you would be?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03104",
   "en": "Tell me about the aliens.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03105",
   "en": "Your survival",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE60_12_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03106",
   "en": "How did they get here?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03107",
   "en": "What do you know?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03108",
   "en": "Help me beat them.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03109",
   "en": "Better her than you.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03110",
   "en": "You did what you had to.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03111",
   "en": "You mean the aliens?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03112",
   "en": "You always that vague? ",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03113",
   "en": "Why do you think? We know what they did.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03114",
   "en": "A team lead would have access. Like Dr. Cohen. He's in the medical bay.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03115",
   "en": "The company wants to bury their mistake. They sent a Matriarch to make us disappear.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03116",
   "en": "Benezia? She's ali--? She's here?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03117",
   "en": "She ordered Ventralis to send you to the hot labs. She expected the rachni to kill you.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03118",
   "en": "Through the checkpoint. Just keep going.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03119",
   "en": "Do whatever you like. I'm getting off this mountain.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03120",
   "en": "Are you here for me?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03121",
   "en": "Do what you want. It doesn't matter.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03122",
   "en": "Get it over with.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03123",
   "en": "The synthetics that attacked you.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03124",
   "en": "I won't let anything happen. Why did she try to kill you?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03125",
   "en": "I need you to listen to me. Are you listening? What happened here?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03126",
   "en": "How can I get into the maintenance area?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03127",
   "en": "They're killing the science team. Why?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03128",
   "en": "Just point me in the right direction.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03129",
   "en": "Let's go collect the lady.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03130",
   "en": "You mean the ge-- the inorganics the asari had with her?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03131",
   "en": "That door's locked. How can I get in?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03132",
   "en": "Who came out of what?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03133",
   "en": "You're safe with me.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03134",
   "en": "Get a hold of yourself.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03135",
   "en": "Why were you attacked?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03137",
   "en": "We'll get her.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03138",
   "en": "The geth?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03139",
   "en": "How do I get in there?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03140",
   "en": "Can I get into maintenance?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03141",
   "en": "The krogan wiped them out a thousand years ago.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03142",
   "en": "The rachni are extinct.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03143",
   "en": "Crazy? I'm sane. God, am I sane.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03144",
   "en": "Yes. I'm the only survivor from the hot lab, you know.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03145",
   "en": "I told you all I can. We brought the rachni back from the dead. In retrospect, a bad decision.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03146",
   "en": "Benezia brought them with her.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03147",
   "en": "I need to know everything about the rachni.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03148",
   "en": "Tell me about the rachni.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03149",
   "en": "She's there now?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03150",
   "en": "I told you to leave.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03151",
   "en": "You know what's in there? You want to kill us all?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03152",
   "en": "I've had four hours of sleep in the last three days. I don't need this.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03153",
   "en": "I thought this was going to be a quiet shift.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03154",
   "en": "You're not part of the crew.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03155",
   "en": "There aren't any human Spectres.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03156",
   "en": "Great. Another human wandering around where they're not wanted.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03157",
   "en": "Look, plague doesn't care who you are. This lab is under quarantine.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03158",
   "en": "Yeah, he radioed. He also said you have to prove you're not contaminated to get out.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03159",
   "en": "You got a death wish, you should stand watches on the barricade.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03160",
   "en": "Call me Shepard. I'm a Spectre, sent by the Citadel.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03162",
   "en": "I have Ventralis' permission to go in there.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03163",
   "en": "I'm Shepard.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03164",
   "en": "I'm here to make a cure.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03165",
   "en": "Okay, this one'll get you.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03166",
   "en": "How can you tell jokes?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03167",
   "en": "So, this hydrogen atom says to another hydrogen: \"I lost my electron!\"",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03168",
   "en": "And the other hydrogen says, \"Man, are you sure?\"",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03169",
   "en": "\"I'm positive!\"",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03170",
   "en": "Just shut up. God.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03171",
   "en": "I've heard this one.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03172",
   "en": "Commander. Looks like that asari \"doctor\" killed the guard.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03173",
   "en": "Huh. The asari garroted the guard. No witnesses.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03174",
   "en": "She killed the guard, Shepard. Just for being in her way.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03175",
   "en": "Then step away from the door.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03176",
   "en": "Could you open the door?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03177",
   "en": "Just looking around.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03178",
   "en": "We need to leave.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03179",
   "en": "You have a cure?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03180",
   "en": "Then let's see it.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03181",
   "en": "The captain says I'm responsible for you not contaminating everyone. I want to see a cure in your hand.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03182",
   "en": "[LIE] Yes.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03183",
   "en": "Don't \"what\" me, mister. Open the damn door.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03184",
   "en": "You have a hearing problem? Let me out.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03185",
   "en": "Let me out.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03186",
   "en": "Open up.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03187",
   "en": "Will I get a \"you know too much\" speech?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03189",
   "en": "[The scientist is resting peacefully.]",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_07A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03190",
   "en": "Mnngh.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_07A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03191",
   "en": "Unnngh.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_07A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03192",
   "en": "Uh. Mnn.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_07A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03193",
   "en": "This system is online and ready to provide emergency services.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_07A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03194",
   "en": "Accessing logs. They were in the midst of an experiment when the shutdown began.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_07A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03195",
   "en": "When you were taken offline.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_07A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03196",
   "en": "Without my program to administrate containment procedures, a quarantine breach occurred.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_07A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u03197",
   "en": "I'm afraid treatment is not possible. An unknown toxin is present within the tissues of each patient.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE60_07A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  }
 ]
}
